   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You wish to draw from a fund you’re creating today with a 3% guaranteed compounded annual rate. You hope to withdraw $40,000 one year from now, $35,000 two years from now, and $25,000 three years from now, at which point the fund will be depleted. How much must you invest today to achieve this?",
